  "worked_solution": "Taking the complex conjugate of each entry, we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\overset{\u2015}{A} & =\\overset{\u2015}{[\\begin{aligned}3\\text{i} & -2+2\\text{i} & 5-5\\text{i} \\\\ \\text{i} & -1+5\\text{i} & -3+4\\text{i} \\\\ -5-3\\text{i} & 4-4\\text{i} & 4\\text{i}\\end{aligned}]} \\\\  & =[\\begin{aligned}\\overset{\u2015}{3\\text{i}} & \\overset{\u2015}{-2+2\\text{i}} & \\overset{\u2015}{5-5\\text{i}} \\\\ \\overset{\u2015}{\\text{i}} & \\overset{\u2015}{-1+5\\text{i}} & \\overset{\u2015}{-3+4\\text{i}} \\\\ \\overset{\u2015}{-5-3\\text{i}} & \\overset{\u2015}{4-4\\text{i}} & \\overset{\u2015}{4\\text{i}}\\end{aligned}] \\\\  & =[\\begin{aligned}-3\\text{i} & -2-2\\text{i} & 5+5\\text{i} \\\\ -\\text{i} & -1-5\\text{i} & -3-4\\text{i} \\\\ -5+3\\text{i} & 4+4\\text{i} & -4\\text{i}\\end{aligned}].\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, ${b}_{12}+{b}_{23}=(-2-2\\text{i})+(-3-4\\text{i})=-5-6\\text{i}.$",
